{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "46b51d54-236e-8196-824a-f1e41613b91c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-22T13:23:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:21:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello Kevin. This is David Gardiner. I'm calling about, um... [pause] the water. By the curb. It's pooling up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:21:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, water at the curb. Where's this at, David? What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:21:29-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I don't have the, I'd rather not say the address on the phone. It's the stretch by my neighbor's place. Where was I. [pause] It's dry out, you understand. No storm. Nothing. Just the melt from the snow pile, and it sits there all day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:21:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha, so meltwater, no storm, just sitting at the curb. Is it backing up out of a drain, or is the drain just not taking it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:21:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It doesn't go anywhere. It sits, and then at night it freezes. Black ice, right across where people walk. Somebody is going to slip on it. An older person, I'd say, the way they go along there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a real hazard. Okay, I'm writing down meltwater ponding, freezing overnight, black ice on the sidewalk side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:22:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And, um, I called before. Last winter, maybe. And the woman told me it was a state road. So they couldn't do anything. That's what she said. A state road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm. Okay. Some roads in town are the state's, that's true. Without a location I can't tell you if this one is. Do you want to give me the cross street at least?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:22:32-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I could. Let me think. No, you know, I lose my place. What I want to know is who do I call. To get it checked. If it's the state, who is it, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:22:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's a state road, that'd be the state highway maintenance folks, not us. But I'd rather our crew go look first and say for sure. If you give me the cross street, I'll put in a request today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:22:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Well. It's a long time to keep passing the buck, is all I'm saying. Every year, the same puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:23:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Cross street, and I'll get it logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me, [pause] I'll have to call you back with that. I'm out now, I need to buy a birthday card and a roll of wrapping paper, and I've already forgotten which store I was going to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:23:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Call back when you've got the cross street and ask for Public Works. Careful out there on the ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-22T13:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you, Kevin."
    }
  ],
